      "message": "Actually we can change it, that\u0027s fine.\n\nThe main reason to enumerate duration quantities separately is to facilitate writing sql queries directly aggregating events of this type.\n\nLet me think about your proposal and see what kind of queries that would yield. I have to think about it a bit.",
